  dialogs:
  - name: Perfectionism
    dialog: Breathe in, Founder... The void is quiet, but your mind is not.
  - name: Perfectionism
    dialog: Your vision... still raw. Still unfinished. Still fragile.
  - name: Perfectionism
    dialog: But that is why I am here.
  - name: Perfectionism
    dialog: Walk forward. Show me the will to build something worthy.
